			"notes": "Changes:\n\n```\n- Added support for colour specification when creating a portal\n- Added client mod for tinting portals when specified on the server, while showing vanilla portals to clients without the mod\n- Added GUI for world creation/customisation and deletion\n- Added proper support for portal deletion from internal registry\n- Removed create, delete and generator command interfaces, replacing them with commands for opening the GUI\n- Updated Polymer\n- Updated to 1.18.1\n- Removed illegal BlockStates\n```"
		},
